  "id": "BIT-gitea-2026-104633",
  "summary": "Gitea migration memory exhaustion from zero page size",
  "details": "When migrating a repository from another Gitea instance, Gitea used the page size reported in the source server's API settings to end its paginated downloads. A source that reported `max_response_items` as `0` made these loops run indefinitely and grow server memory until it was exhausted. Any user who can migrate repositories could point a migration at a server they control and cause a denial of service.",
